---
import MathLayout from '../../../layouts/MathLayout.astro';
import { getPath } from '../../../utils/path';

const lang = 'zh';
const currentPath = '/zh/university/analysis';
const title = '数学分析';
---

<MathLayout {title} {lang} {currentPath}>
	<article>
		<h1>{title}</h1>
		<p class="intro">分析学研究连续量的数学。人类发现数本身有一条裂缝——有些长度不能被有理数表达，而这就是实数的诞生地。</p>

		<h2>实数公理：接受那片"连续性黑夜"</h2>
		<div class="concept-card card">
			<p>完备性公理：任何有上界的非空实数集，都有上确界。这不是构造，而是承认——宣告实数线没有缺口。</p>
		</div>

		<h2>完备性的五条等价命题</h2>
		<div class="five-equivalents">
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>1. 确界原理</h3>
				<p>有上界的非空实数集必有上确界</p>
			</div>
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>2. 单调有界定理</h3>
				<p>单调递增且有上界的序列必然收敛</p>
			</div>
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>3. 区间套定理</h3>
				<p>闭区间套长度趋于零则交于唯一一点</p>
			</div>
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>4. B-W定理</h3>
				<p>任何有界序列必有收敛子列</p>
			</div>
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>5. 柯西准则</h3>
				<p>序列项彼此越来越近则必收敛</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>核心概念层级</h2>
		<div class="levels-hierarchy">
			<div class="level-item">
				<span class="level-num">L1</span>
				<span class="level-content">实数（完备性）</span>
			</div>
			<div class="level-item">
				<span class="level-num">L2</span>
				<span class="level-content">序列（ℕ → ℝ）</span>
			</div>
			<div class="level-item">
				<span class="level-num">L3</span>
				<span class="level-content">函数（ℝ → ℝ）</span>
			</div>
			<div class="level-item">
				<span class="level-num">L4</span>
				<span class="level-content">函数列（ℕ → 函数空间）</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>重要定理</h2>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>介值定理</h3>
			<p>若 $f$ 在闭区间上连续，则它在两端之间取遍每一个值。</p>
		</div>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>极值定理</h3>
			<p>闭区间上的连续函数，必在某处取到最大值和最小值。</p>
		</div>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>微积分基本定理</h3>
			<p>微分和积分锁成一对逆运算。</p>
		</div>

		<h2>学习路径</h2>
		<div class="learning-path">
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">1</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>实数完备性</h3>
					<p>确界原理、五条等价命题</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">2</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>序列</h3>
					<p>收敛、发散、上下极限</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">3</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>连续函数</h3>
					<p>ε-δ、介值定理、极值定理</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">4</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>微分</h3>
					<p>导数、中值定理、泰勒展开</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">5</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>积分</h3>
					<p>黎曼积分、微积分基本定理</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>与其他学科的连接</h2>
		<div class="connections">
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">⟷</span>
				<span>拓扑学 - 开集上的连续映射</span>
			</div>
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">⟷</span>
				<span>复分析 - 从实到复的推广</span>
			</div>
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">⟷</span>
				<span>测度论 - 积分的严格化</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="nav-footer">
			<a href={getPath('/zh/university')} class="back-link">← 返回大学数学</a>
		</div>
	</article>
</MathLayout>

<style>
	.intro {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.concept-card {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.concept-card p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.five-equivalents {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.equiv-item {
		padding: 1rem;
		background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 3px solid #6366f1;
	}

	.equiv-item h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #f1f5f9;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.equiv-item p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.levels-hierarchy {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.level-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0.75rem;
		background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.level-num {
		padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.level-content {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.theorem-card {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1);
		border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
	}

	.theorem-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #f1f5f9;
	}

	.theorem-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.learning-path {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.path-step {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
	}

	.path-step:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.step-num {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 2rem;
		height: 2rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #f43f5e);
		border-radius: 50%;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.step-content h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
		color: #f1f5f9;
	}

	.step-content p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.connections {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.connection-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0.75rem;
		background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.05);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.conn-icon {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: #f97316;
	}

	.nav-footer {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: #f97316;
	}
</style>
